{"id":"b662179811b5cc72","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-product-sum-adjoint.md","title":"thm-product-sum-adjunctions","display":"thm-product-sum-adjunctions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-product-sum-adjoint","aliases":["16-thm-product-sum-adjoint","16-thm--product-sum-adjoint"],"display":"thm-product-sum-adjunctions","depends_on":["[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[16-df-functor]]"],"source":"Preliminaries, pp. xiii–xiv (PDF 15–16); Section 2.3; explicit universal-property derivation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-product-sum-adjoint"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-product-sum-adjoint</span><span>16-thm--product-sum-adjoint</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-product-sum-adjunctions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Preliminaries, pp. xiii–xiv (PDF 15–16); Section 2.3; explicit universal-property derivation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a> 的 CCC，固定终对象、积、指数和评价。还假设每对对象具有二元余积，固定余积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\sqcup Y\">\\(X\\sqcup Y\\)</span>、内射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_1^{X,Y},\\iota_2^{X,Y}\">\\(\\iota_1^{X,Y},\\iota_2^{X,Y}\\)</span>；其泛性质和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinCoprod}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinCoprod}\\)</span> 在下文展开。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle f,g\\rangle\">\\(\\langle f,g\\rangle\\)</span> 表示积的唯一介体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f,g]\">\\([f,g]\\)</span> 表示余积的唯一介体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_B(f):A\\to Z^B\">\\(\\Lambda_B(f):A\\to Z^B\\)</span> 表示指数泛性质的唯一转置。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是下列六元组构造的积范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_B,E_B:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(P_B,E_B:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(S:\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C\">\\(\\Delta:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C\\)</span> 在下文构造。伴随符号采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a> 的自然 Hom 双射定义，函子采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,Z\">\\(A,Z\\)</span> 为索引的映射族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,Y),Z\">\\((X,Y),Z\\)</span> 为索引的映射族。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\">\\(B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,Z,X,Y,X^\\prime,Y^\\prime\">\\(A,Z,X,Y,X^\\prime,Y^\\prime\\)</span> 在各式中取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,h\">\\(f,g,h\\)</span> 取式中所示源靶的箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{A,Z}:\\mathcal C(A\\times B,Z)\\to\\mathcal C(A,Z^B)\">\\(\\Phi_{A,Z}:\\mathcal C(A\\times B,Z)\\to\\mathcal C(A,Z^B)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}:\\mathcal C(X\\sqcup Y,Z)\\to\\mathcal C(X,Z)\\times\\mathcal C(Y,Z)\">\\(\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}:\\mathcal C(X\\sqcup Y,Z)\\to\\mathcal C(X,Z)\\times\\mathcal C(Y,Z)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BinCoprod}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists j_1:X\\to W)(\\exists j_2:Y\\to W)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall f:X\\to Z)(\\forall g:Y\\to Z)\n(\\exists!h:W\\to Z)\\ (hj_1=f\\land hj_2=g).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BinCoprod}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists j_1:X\\to W)(\\exists j_2:Y\\to W)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall f:X\\to Z)(\\forall g:Y\\to Z)\n(\\exists!h:W\\to Z)\\ (hj_1=f\\land hj_2=g).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_2&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)^2,\n\\qquad M_2\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal C)^2,\\\\\ns_2(f,g)&amp;\\coloneqq(sf,sg),\\qquad t_2(f,g)\\coloneqq(tf,tg),\\\\\ne_2(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_X,\\operatorname{id}_Y),\\\\\nc_2((g_1,g_2),(f_1,f_2))&amp;\\coloneqq(g_1f_1,g_2f_2),\\\\\n\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_2,M_2,s_2,t_2,e_2,c_2\\rangle,\\\\\nP_B(X)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\times B,\n\\qquad P_B(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\\langle f\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\rangle,\\\\\nE_B(X)&amp;\\coloneqq X^B,\n\\qquad E_B(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\\Lambda_B(f\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{B,X}),\\\\\nS(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\sqcup Y,\n\\qquad S(f:X\\to X&#39;,g:Y\\to Y&#39;)\\coloneqq[\\iota_1^{X&#39;,Y&#39;}f,\\iota_2^{X&#39;,Y&#39;}g],\\\\\n\\Delta(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(X,X),\\qquad\\Delta(f)\\coloneqq(f,f),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,Z}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Lambda_B(f),\n\\qquad\\Phi_{A,Z}^{-1}(h)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}_{B,Z}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_B),\\\\\n\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}(h)&amp;\\coloneqq(h\\iota_1^{X,Y},h\\iota_2^{X,Y}),\n\\qquad\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}^{-1}(f,g)\\coloneqq[f,g],\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdjHom}(P_B,E_B,\\Phi)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{AdjHom}(S,\\Delta,\\Psi),\\\\\nP_B&amp;\\dashv E_B,\\qquad S\\dashv\\Delta.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_2&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)^2,\n\\qquad M_2\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal C)^2,\\\\\ns_2(f,g)&amp;\\coloneqq(sf,sg),\\qquad t_2(f,g)\\coloneqq(tf,tg),\\\\\ne_2(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_X,\\operatorname{id}_Y),\\\\\nc_2((g_1,g_2),(f_1,f_2))&amp;\\coloneqq(g_1f_1,g_2f_2),\\\\\n\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_2,M_2,s_2,t_2,e_2,c_2\\rangle,\\\\\nP_B(X)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\times B,\n\\qquad P_B(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\\langle f\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\rangle,\\\\\nE_B(X)&amp;\\coloneqq X^B,\n\\qquad E_B(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\\Lambda_B(f\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{B,X}),\\\\\nS(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq X\\sqcup Y,\n\\qquad S(f:X\\to X&#39;,g:Y\\to Y&#39;)\\coloneqq[\\iota_1^{X&#39;,Y&#39;}f,\\iota_2^{X&#39;,Y&#39;}g],\\\\\n\\Delta(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(X,X),\\qquad\\Delta(f)\\coloneqq(f,f),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,Z}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Lambda_B(f),\n\\qquad\\Phi_{A,Z}^{-1}(h)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}_{B,Z}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_B),\\\\\n\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}(h)&amp;\\coloneqq(h\\iota_1^{X,Y},h\\iota_2^{X,Y}),\n\\qquad\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}^{-1}(f,g)\\coloneqq[f,g],\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdjHom}(P_B,E_B,\\Phi)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{AdjHom}(S,\\Delta,\\Psi),\\\\\nP_B&amp;\\dashv E_B,\\qquad S\\dashv\\Delta.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>积、指数、余积泛性质分别保证上述箭头运算与唯一介体良定义；唯一性给函子律。指数的 β、η 以及余积介体的两个方程证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi,\\Psi\">\\(\\Phi,\\Psi\\)</span> 与其所列逆互逆；预复合、后复合的相容性同样由唯一性得到，所以两族双射自然。</li>\n<li>此处为普通范畴的二元余积伴随，不依赖语法 sum-type 原子。来源：Jacobs, Preliminaries, pp. xiii–xiv（PDF 15–16），§2.3 的产品/指数/余积泛性质；本页内建展开伴随的函子与双射数据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","