ex":"\\Delta:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"A,Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"(X,Y),Z","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"A,Z,X,Y,X^\\prime,Y^\\prime","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"f,g,h","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_{A,Z}:\\mathcal C(A\\times B,Z)\\to\\mathcal C(A,Z^B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}:\\mathcal C(X\\sqcup Y,Z)\\to\\mathcal C(X,Z)\\times\\mathcal C(Y,Z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BinCoprod}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists j_1:X\\to W)(\\exists j_2:Y\\to W)\\\\\n&\\quad(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\forall f:X\\to Z)(\\forall g:Y\\to Z)\n(\\exists!h:W\\to Z)\\ (hj_1=f\\land hj_2=g).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_2&\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)^2,\n\\qquad M_2\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal C)^2,\\\\\ns_2(f,g)&\\coloneqq(sf,sg),\\qquad t_2(f,g)\\coloneqq(tf,tg),\\\\\ne_2(X,Y)&\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_X,\\operatorname{id}_Y),\\\\\nc_2((g_1,g_2),(f_1,f_2))&\\coloneqq(g_1f_1,g_2f_2),\\\\\n\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C&\\coloneqq\\langle O_2,M_2,s_2,t_2,e_2,c_2\\rangle,\\\\\nP_B(X)&\\coloneqq X\\times B,\n\\qquad P_B(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\\langle f\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\rangle,\\\\\nE_B(X)&\\coloneqq X^B,\n\\qquad E_B(f:X\\to Y)\\coloneqq\\Lambda_B(f\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{B,X}),\\\\\nS(X,Y)&\\coloneqq X\\sqcup Y,\n\\qquad S(f:X\\to X',g:Y\\to Y')\\coloneqq[\\iota_1^{X',Y'}f,\\iota_2^{X',Y'}g],\\\\\n\\Delta(X)&\\coloneqq(X,X),\\qquad\\Delta(f)\\coloneqq(f,f),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,Z}(f)&\\coloneqq\\Lambda_B(f),\n\\qquad\\Phi_{A,Z}^{-1}(h)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ev}_{B,Z}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_B),\\\\\n\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}(h)&\\coloneqq(h\\iota_1^{X,Y},h\\iota_2^{X,Y}),\n\\qquad\\Psi_{(X,Y),Z}^{-1}(f,g)\\coloneqq[f,g],\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdjHom}(P_B,E_B,\\Phi)&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{AdjHom}(S,\\Delta,\\Psi),\\\\\nP_B&\\dashv E_B,\\qquad S\\dashv\\Delta.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi,\\Psi","display":false}],"bytes":3713,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-439","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-product-sum-adjoint|thm-product-sum-adjunctions]]"},{"id":"4d7b1b6f9345e344","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_I\\times\\mathcal E_I$ 使用 [[16-thm-product-sum-adjoint]] 的六元组积范畴。$\\Delta_I,\\sqcup_I,\\sqcap_I$ 的两个分量由下式定义；$X,Y,X',Y'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I$，$f:X\\to X',g:Y\\to Y'$ 为垂直箭头。$X\\vee_IY,X\\wedge_IY$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]] 的同一选择；预序性保证末两项单元素集合的唯一性。$\\dashv_\\epsilon$ 采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。"}],"outgoing":["18a4c8ba03fadf06","a88937ea87ff8530","fc49efccd7348d66"]}